01:30.387 --> 01:33.367
If you let me eat you, I'll tell you.

01:41.357 --> 01:42.467
O Lord...

01:42.467 --> 01:46.977
...Mask of Flesh and Bone, All Creation, Flutter of Wings, Ye who bears the name of Man...

01:46.977 --> 01:48.277
...Truth and Temperance...

01:48.277 --> 01:51.297
Upon this sinless wall of dreams unleash but slightly the wrath of your claws.

01:51.867 --> 01:53.147
Way of Destruction, number 33...

01:53.147 --> 01:54.517
SOUKATSUI!

01:57.787 --> 01:58.367
It worked...

01:58.367 --> 02:00.987
Good, at least I have some powe-

02:05.627 --> 02:06.487
It can't be.

02:06.487 --> 02:07.617
It's unharmed?

02:08.967 --> 02:10.917
I know that spell.

02:10.917 --> 02:12.657
It's a Shinigami's spell.

02:12.657 --> 02:13.947
Isn't it?

02:13.947 --> 02:16.627
But yours is so weak.

02:16.627 --> 02:18.037
It didn't hurt a bit.

02:19.587 --> 02:20.497
Damn!

02:20.497 --> 02:24.747
So I still haven't recovered enough to use that level of demon magic.

02:29.437 --> 02:30.907
How many years has it been...

02:32.227 --> 02:33.437
...since Karin's cried...

02:34.867 --> 02:36.267
Until Mom died...

02:36.787 --> 02:39.607
...Karin was a crybaby just like Yuzu.

02:41.127 --> 02:49.327
When Mom died, strong and capable little Yuzu started doing the housework piece by piece to try to fill the hole.

02:50.967 --> 02:56.157
Karin, who wasn't so capable, tried at least not to worry the family...

02:56.157 --> 02:57.997
...so she stopped crying, no matter what happened.

02:59.137 --> 03:01.337
Not even when she fought with a bigger kid and lost.

03:02.437 --> 03:05.337
Not even when she threw a ball through the principal's window and got a lecture.

03:06.817 --> 03:09.297
Not even when she broke her leg on a school hike.

03:10.657 --> 03:12.467
She didn't cry even once.

03:16.497 --> 03:18.607
Karin, leave it to me.

03:25.337 --> 03:27.777
You're a Shinigami?

03:28.277 --> 03:31.697
Why don't you shed that human shell?!

03:45.607 --> 03:48.717
It-It hit...?

03:50.697 --> 03:52.097
He hit the Hollow...

03:52.947 --> 03:54.967
He can see ghosts?!

03:57.447 --> 03:59.307
Uh, I guess not.

04:01.077 --> 04:02.117
What the hell?!

04:02.117 --> 04:04.017
A lucky punch?!

04:04.537 --> 04:06.397
I almost thought he could see-

04:10.837 --> 04:12.697
Alright, that hit.

04:14.297 --> 04:15.317
That's impossible...

04:15.797 --> 04:20.537
If he can't see the Hollow, he shouldn't be able to hear it, either.

04:21.517 --> 04:26.627
He's coolly confronting an enemy he can't discern?

04:27.647 --> 04:30.827
Doesn't he have any concept of fear?!

04:34.447 --> 04:35.557
Damn!

04:41.617 --> 04:43.477
Can't lift a finger, can you?!

04:43.867 --> 04:47.647
What are you gonna do, little Miss Lame-ass Shinigami?

04:48.547 --> 04:49.777
Don't just stand there!

04:49.777 --> 04:50.637
Run!

04:50.637 --> 04:51.727
It's flying!

04:52.507 --> 04:55.277
Transfer student, you can see ghosts?

04:55.277 --> 04:57.287
That doesn't matter.

04:57.287 --> 04:59.297
In any case, at that distance...

04:59.297 --> 05:00.057
Where is it?

05:00.057 --> 05:00.737
What?

05:01.597 --> 05:02.627
It's flying, isn't it?

05:02.977 --> 05:04.417
Which direction?

05:04.417 --> 05:06.547
Why do you ask that?

05:08.437 --> 05:09.557
So I can do this.

05:12.987 --> 05:15.387
Well, what should I do now?

05:15.387 --> 05:19.767
Maybe I'll finish you like a falcon and hit-and-run from up he-

05:25.667 --> 05:27.227
What the hell?!

05:28.037 --> 05:29.947
Now, which direction?

05:30.337 --> 05:31.517
Straight ahead!

05:31.517 --> 05:32.977
Swing it down straight ahead!

05:43.557 --> 05:45.377
Now, give up.

05:45.377 --> 05:48.167
Someone who can get rid of you will be here soon.

05:52.937 --> 05:54.217
What's so funny?!

05:56.197 --> 06:04.147
Geez, that's why every one of you Shinigamis gets beaten by us!

06:10.587 --> 06:12.977
This is what they call a reversal of fortune.

06:13.457 --> 06:20.117
You damn Shinigamis underestimate us Hollows, that's why stuff like this happens to you.

06:22.847 --> 06:26.537
Let's see, which should I eat first...

06:26.537 --> 06:29.377
Okay, the man goes later...

06:33.777 --> 06:35.597
WHAT THE HELL?!

06:35.887 --> 06:38.657
H-H-H-H-H-How reckless!

06:38.657 --> 06:42.677
You gonna let your muscles do the talking and take care of every little thing?!

06:42.677 --> 06:43.887
You muscle-boun-

06:47.117 --> 06:50.027
His intuition is freaking amazing!

06:50.627 --> 06:51.777
Over here, Chad!

06:52.127 --> 06:53.477
Kick above me!

06:55.457 --> 06:57.117
Dammit!

07:01.967 --> 07:03.557
No, not there.

07:03.557 --> 07:04.247
In the sky!

07:05.137 --> 07:05.837
The sky?

07:05.837 --> 07:07.247
I have an idea.

07:09.397 --> 07:10.377
Transfer student...

07:12.477 --> 07:15.347
You're really... gonna go like this?

07:15.347 --> 07:16.217
That's right.

07:16.897 --> 07:20.167
We'll apply your Herculean strength and my abilities.

07:21.317 --> 07:24.647
Somehow, this seems really dumb...

07:24.647 --> 07:26.637
You're not one to talk.

07:27.197 --> 07:27.827
Get ready.

07:27.827 --> 07:28.807
Tiger direction.

07:29.707 --> 07:30.697
Which way is Tiger?

07:31.877 --> 07:32.827
The left!

07:32.827 --> 07:33.917
Left...

07:33.917 --> 07:35.447
Fool, too high!

07:38.757 --> 07:39.947
Alright, let's go.

07:42.277 --> 07:46.267
If I escape this high, even a telephone pole won't reach-

07:46.267 --> 07:47.077
Launch!

07:51.267 --> 07:52.367
Give up.

07:52.367 --> 07:54.587
O-O-Okay!

07:54.897 --> 07:56.337
I will give up!

07:56.877 --> 07:58.007
Not.

08:09.787 --> 08:11.107
W-What's wrong?

08:12.707 --> 08:15.477
Sorry, I was caught unprepared.

08:15.787 --> 08:18.197
Dammit, what are these?

08:18.757 --> 08:19.867
Leeches?!

08:20.917 --> 08:22.157
Exactly.

08:23.637 --> 08:26.507
They don't come off easily.

08:26.507 --> 08:30.127
Plus, those are my targets.

08:35.857 --> 08:36.707
Transfer student!

08:39.877 --> 08:41.637
W-What happened?

08:42.877 --> 08:44.277
Surprised?

08:44.277 --> 08:46.857
Those leeches are mini bombs.

08:46.857 --> 08:49.887
They resonate with the sound from my tongue and explode.

08:50.197 --> 08:51.407
Geez!

08:51.407 --> 08:53.107
Letting your guard down...

09:08.387 --> 09:09.997
Wanna go, big boy?

09:09.997 --> 09:11.617
But you got...

09:16.227 --> 09:20.257
Oh, he ran away just now to buy time to bring that here.

09:20.777 --> 09:22.427
Sorry, mister.

09:23.237 --> 09:24.507
I got caught.

09:24.817 --> 09:25.887
Shibata...

09:25.887 --> 09:29.227
Looks like you understand, huh, big boy.

09:29.867 --> 09:34.477
Now then, it's time to play with you, little Miss Shinigami.

09:34.477 --> 09:35.917
Run around!

09:35.917 --> 09:39.937
So I can have fun hunting you and only you.

09:44.927 --> 09:46.697
Don't move from here, Chad.

09:46.697 --> 09:51.287
If you move an inch, it intends to blow up the birdcage.

09:52.887 --> 09:54.907
Transfer student, what about you?

09:55.977 --> 09:57.957
You needn't worry about me.

09:58.807 --> 10:00.167
I won't slip up.

10:01.107 --> 10:02.257
I've promised that.

10:03.277 --> 10:04.507
Promised?

10:11.577 --> 10:13.897
This is starting to get fun.

10:31.647 --> 10:33.617
You're covered, now!

10:45.437 --> 10:48.917
I like that blood-soaked look.

10:49.617 --> 10:51.727
You're so cute.

10:52.387 --> 10:54.637
I can't take it!

10:56.117 --> 10:58.767
Come on! Come on! Come on! Come on! Come on! COME ON!

10:59.107 --> 11:01.447
How far you gonna run?!

11:01.447 --> 11:04.547
You can attack me back if you want!

11:04.547 --> 11:07.067
Come on, little Miss Shinigami!

11:14.007 --> 11:14.827
What?!

11:19.477 --> 11:22.047
You are giving up already?

11:22.767 --> 11:25.317
That's no fun.

11:25.317 --> 11:27.337
Go run some more!

11:27.817 --> 11:29.507
I haven't given up.

11:29.507 --> 11:29.967
Huh?

11:30.987 --> 11:32.927
I no longer need to run.

11:32.927 --> 11:34.307
What?!

11:34.697 --> 11:37.097
You said I could counter-attack if I wanted.

11:38.997 --> 11:42.727
Then I'll take advantage of that offer!

11:51.597 --> 11:55.827
Then I'll take advantage of that offer!

12:01.577 --> 12:03.337
Right, Ichigo?

12:04.707 --> 12:06.937
"Right, Ichigo," my ass.

12:06.937 --> 12:10.007
Didn't you say you wouldn't have any slip-ups for me to worry about?

12:10.247 --> 12:11.217
Fool!

12:11.217 --> 12:14.887
That's what someone who was at least a little worried would say.

12:16.797 --> 12:17.937
That's true, too.

12:19.507 --> 12:20.687
You bastard...

12:21.717 --> 12:24.647
How long you gonna stand on my head?!

12:26.057 --> 12:28.017
Kurosaki Ichigo, 15 years old.

12:28.017 --> 12:30.407
Currently, a substitute Shinigami.

12:32.227 --> 12:36.117
If you wanted to play tag, you were playing with the wrong person.

12:38.157 --> 12:40.827
Substitute Shinigami?

12:41.407 --> 12:42.457
Dammit!

12:42.457 --> 12:47.917
If that's how it was, I should've went after you from the start!

12:53.507 --> 12:54.177
Ichigo!

13:00.757 --> 13:02.427
Too slow, retard!

13:07.727 --> 13:09.857
You smell the most tasty.

13:16.407 --> 13:17.717
Oh, I see.

13:17.717 --> 13:22.707
You used those bombs to tie down Chad and have fun attacking the woman?

13:23.157 --> 13:25.957
You're a dirty son of a bitch, aren't you?

13:27.157 --> 13:31.717
But you're about to be eaten by that dirty son of a bitch!

13:34.917 --> 13:35.967
I-Ichigo!

13:36.917 --> 13:38.267
What's wrong, Ichigo?

13:38.797 --> 13:39.427
Chad!

13:40.087 --> 13:40.977
Perfect timing.

13:40.977 --> 13:44.347
Hide him and the cockatiel somewhere safe.

13:45.097 --> 13:47.557
Transfer student, what the heck is this?

13:48.807 --> 13:49.607
Don't worry.

13:50.017 --> 13:53.237
He's fighting at this very moment.

14:09.917 --> 14:11.337
Nice moves.

14:11.337 --> 14:12.457
But remember...

14:12.457 --> 14:18.057
...the leeches from those slash wounds are still bombs!

14:32.687 --> 14:35.487
I got one thing I wanna ask you.

14:37.187 --> 14:41.407
Are you the one who killed the parents of the kid in that cockatiel?

14:45.977 --> 14:47.287
What did you say?

14:47.287 --> 14:49.497
It's all my fault.

14:50.287 --> 14:54.127
It's my fault you and Mister got hurt.

14:55.087 --> 14:55.837
Shibata...

14:57.127 --> 15:00.887
Because I wanted to bring mommy back to life...

15:02.587 --> 15:04.587
I'm sorry.

15:04.587 --> 15:07.147
I want mommy to come back to life, but...

15:08.057 --> 15:08.707
...but...

15:08.707 --> 15:09.177
Wait.

15:10.477 --> 15:13.817
Did someone say they would bring back your mother?

15:14.937 --> 15:18.937
Did someone tell you there was a way to do that?

15:19.357 --> 15:20.407
That's right.

15:22.147 --> 15:25.617
I'm the one who killed that kid's mom...

15:25.617 --> 15:28.287
...when I was still alive.

15:28.697 --> 15:31.407
Back then, I was a serial killer.

15:31.407 --> 15:35.687
There was a pretty big fuss about me on TV, I was famous.

15:35.687 --> 15:39.257
That kid's mom was the last one.

15:39.257 --> 15:41.277
That was fun...

15:41.277 --> 15:43.857
She ran around so frantically.

15:43.857 --> 15:49.257
She could hardly breathe anymore, but she still tried to protect the kid.

15:49.257 --> 15:51.227
It gave me chills.

15:51.637 --> 15:53.957
But that's when the bad part started.

15:53.957 --> 15:56.897
When I'd cornered them on the veranda...

15:56.897 --> 16:00.657
...that damn kid... grabbed my shoelace.

16:01.527 --> 16:06.367
I can't believe I died in such a stupid way.

16:08.737 --> 16:11.837
I decided to punish the kid.

16:12.537 --> 16:17.297
I shoved his living soul into the cockatiel and said to him...

16:18.207 --> 16:19.757
"Three months."

16:19.757 --> 16:22.247
"Run around looking like that for that long."

16:22.247 --> 16:25.757
"If you can do that, I'll bring your mommy back to life."

16:26.347 --> 16:27.637
Bring her back...

16:27.637 --> 16:29.057
Idiot!

16:29.057 --> 16:30.757
As if I could!

16:30.757 --> 16:33.527
Bringing a dead person back to life, hah!

16:34.057 --> 16:36.217
But the kid believed me.

16:36.217 --> 16:37.607
He ran away desperately.

16:38.307 --> 16:40.767
The interesting part of this punishment was...

16:40.767 --> 16:45.487
...killing every single human who tried to protect the kid.

16:45.487 --> 16:48.417
Everytime I did, the kid would whine...

16:48.417 --> 16:49.907
"I don't wanna do this anymore."

16:49.907 --> 16:52.577
"I don't like this."

16:52.577 --> 16:54.747
Then I'd say my line...

16:54.747 --> 16:58.587
"Mommy's waiting for your help, you know."

16:58.587 --> 17:02.547
Just from that, he'd get all happy again...

17:03.007 --> 17:06.507
...crying, "Mommy! Mommy!"..

17:09.047 --> 17:11.187
Look at you trembling!

17:11.187 --> 17:12.767
Your guard's completely down!

17:14.847 --> 17:17.347
This time, it's over!

17:25.527 --> 17:27.287
You can have these bombs back!

17:29.407 --> 17:30.447
What's wrong?

17:30.447 --> 17:32.417
Aren't you gonna make them explode?

17:32.987 --> 17:34.867
Try ringing that tongue of yours.

17:37.747 --> 17:39.327
Not gonna ring it?

17:39.667 --> 17:42.547
Then this tongue... IS MINE NOW!

17:45.167 --> 17:47.637
My tongue...

17:51.307 --> 17:52.897
DIE!!!

18:15.077 --> 18:15.917
It's Hell.

18:16.327 --> 18:20.337
The zanpakutou can only wash away sins after death.

18:22.037 --> 18:24.967
For Hollows who've committed mortal sins in life...

18:25.297 --> 18:27.257
...the Gates of Hell will open.

19:06.497 --> 19:08.717
Did he go to Hell?

19:18.717 --> 19:19.477
How about it?

19:20.557 --> 19:21.437
It's unfortunate.

19:22.097 --> 19:25.607
His chain of fate has already been severed and there's no trace of it.

19:26.227 --> 19:28.527
He can't return to his body anymore.

19:28.897 --> 19:29.947
But...

19:31.527 --> 19:32.327
Shibata...

19:33.817 --> 19:34.787
Don't worry.

19:35.237 --> 19:38.207
Soul Society isn't a scary place.

19:41.287 --> 19:42.787
You never get hungry...

19:42.787 --> 19:44.007
Your body's light as a feather...

19:44.367 --> 19:46.967
It's 80 to 90% better than here.

19:48.207 --> 19:50.597
That's a heck of a way for a moocher to talk.

19:52.757 --> 19:55.097
But I guess you might be right.

19:55.507 --> 19:58.897
At least, if you go there, you can see your mom.

20:00.517 --> 20:02.857
Although we can't bring your mom back here...

20:03.227 --> 20:06.237
...now, you can go there.

20:08.397 --> 20:09.157
Ichigo...

20:14.397 --> 20:15.287
Mister...

20:16.027 --> 20:17.617
...thanks for everything.

20:18.737 --> 20:24.547
I didn't get hurt because you carried me while running around.

20:26.127 --> 20:27.247
It was nothing.

20:29.877 --> 20:32.057
Okay then, I'll go now.

20:33.007 --> 20:34.517
Thank you so much.

20:35.377 --> 20:36.297
Yuuichi...

20:39.637 --> 20:41.477
If I die and go to the other side...

20:42.177 --> 20:45.647
...can I carry you and run around again?

20:49.727 --> 20:50.277
Sure!

21:00.407 --> 21:01.537
Well now...

21:01.537 --> 21:03.497
...shall we go ahead with the soul burial?

21:21.597 --> 21:23.647
Thanks, Ichi-nii...

